WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.660
Daram of the Buff Clan aliens...

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:31.290
attacked Earth's colony planet
 Caral to lure in the Solo Ship.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:36.550
Despite his attempt to take over the
Giant by destroying its barrier,

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.590
Cosmo managed to turn the situation around.

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:47.940
<b>Fight the Guerrilla Infiltrators</b>

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.540
So they haven't moved much since our battle?

00:02:16.810 --> 00:02:17.260
Yes.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:18.520
Is there a specific reason for that?

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:19.580
Quite possibly.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:21.470
They could be resupplying.

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:25.960
If that wasn't the case, that ship
 would have left the planet already.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:28.480
All right, this is a good oppoturnity.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:31.560
We'll survey the enemy's movements
 and seize the Giant right away.

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:36.440
There it is!

00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:37.610
That's it!

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.740
Caral was ruined because of that thing!

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:42.030
Maybe that's an alien ship too!

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:43.910
It really might be!

00:02:55.210 --> 00:02:58.000
Do the people of Caral still hold a grudge against us?

00:02:58.010 --> 00:02:58.510
Yes.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:01.280
The battle will drag on now that you have arrived.

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:02.800
It's the Buff Clan!

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:06.240
The Buff Clan keeps chasing us with their
Heavy Mobile Mecha, forcing us to fight.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.350
We're not seeking fights on purpose!

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:13.150
In any case, you need to leave
 this planet as soon as possible.

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:16.520
I wouldn't have told you about Stagra otherwise.

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:18.400
We'll leave.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.610
Once we get some weapons
and ammunition, we'll leave.

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:22.810
Even Bes promised that much.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:26.410
It's a good thing your father was a logistics officer...

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.950
Don't talk about the dead!

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:31.810
Like I told you, I just want you to leave.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.320
I just want everyone to make peace.

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:40.030
Yet you tell us to leave...

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:45.450
This is where Stagra is located.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.930
There has to be enough weapons
 and ammunition for us too!

00:03:57.730 --> 00:04:00.320
We know that Stagra is Caral's weapon depot!

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.530
Who told you about Stagra?!

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:05.410
One of the soldiers on Caral told us.

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:07.990
It's not a place just anyone knows.

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:09.980
The Solo Ship is heading for Stagra!

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:11.190
You can't do this!

00:04:11.530 --> 00:04:12.330
It's Stagra!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.570
Isn't it over there, Commander?

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.420
Altitude 50! We're going in!

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:17.500
Stop!

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:18.730
Stop this ship!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:22.590
Commander, if all the troops around this area
 were killed, why do you want to stop us?

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:24.140
Don't butt in, kid!

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:26.220
The Buff Clan could come here at any moment!

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.510
All the more reason for you to give us supplies.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:29.640
Bes!

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.430
Call me a traitor if you want.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:35.100
Order them to let the Solo Ship in!

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.230
You bastard!

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:52.200
Drop off the Ideon around this area.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:53.980
It'll guard us from the outside.

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:08.390
Have you landed?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.510
Doesn't the Ideon seem powerful
 when you're inside it?

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:12.010
Yes.

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:14.950
But the Buff Clan is nothing to scoff at.

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:17.920
They keep on sending machines to
take down the Ideon, one after another.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:22.250
We need a ton of missiles and repair
materials to even stand a chance.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.290
The guards are here!

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.080
Order them to deliver us weapons.

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:38.540
The mic...

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.030
This is Parkinson!

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.160
Addressing all the guards of Stagra!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:47.300
The Solo Ship wants to be supplied
with weapons and ammunition, but...

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.640
Don't give them a single bullet!!

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.260
They are all traitors!

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:52.010
Commander Parkinson!
They are all traitors!

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:55.250
I won't give in to your threats!

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:56.020
Commander!

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.310
Why, you...

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:00.710
We'll protect Caral on our own!

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:01.770
That's impossible!

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.320
There's the civilian reserve troops.

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.030
No way!

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.240
It's always like this!

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:09.870
What if the Buff Clan comes here
 while they're wasting time?

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:11.140
Cosmo, what you going to do?

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:13.080
We have to take them by force.

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.700
I can help you!

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:17.410
I know most of the soldiers in Stagra.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:18.830
Please.

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:22.250
Promise you'll leave right after that, okay?

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.910
We're at the designated point.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:45.900
Gatakka team, get ready to launch!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.110
Scout the area!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:08.340
Halt!

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:10.100
It's me! Kitty Kitten!

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:10.970
Miss!

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:12.890
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:15.220
Please hand over the weapons to the Solo Ship.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.310
This isn't a place for you, miss!

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:18.720
You need to leave!

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:20.980
The aliens are coming!

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:24.190
The Ideon and Solo Ship are fighting
 with scarce resources, and yet you...

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.020
What was that?!

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:26.610
What!?

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.940
There are alien fighters in front of Stagra?

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.610
Can't you fight them?

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:32.030
What'd I tell you?!

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:33.530
Listen!

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:36.200
This isn't the time for us Earthlings to bicker!

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:37.830
Kitten!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:38.890
Head over to the Solo Ship!

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:39.320
But...

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:40.710
Do you want to die?

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.880
You have those kids you need to protect, Kitten!

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:46.930
Tell that Solo Ship to defend us, too!

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:05.150
We're close!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.530
It's right in front of my eyes!

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:24.590
Gije! What do we do?

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:27.130
We didn't plan to just come right across it like this!

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:28.790
Yes, exactly...

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:30.330
What should we do?

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:35.300
I see!

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:38.460
It's staying still, so the Giant doesn't have a pilot!

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:39.930
Stop the reconnaissance!

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:41.520
We'll take the Giant back with us!

00:08:41.560 --> 00:08:42.260
What?

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:43.980
That's a good idea!

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:45.350
It's just waiting to be captured anyway!

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:46.560
Sir Daram!

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.110
We're about to take over the Giant!

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:48.860
Send us backup!

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:49.930
Don't be so dependant!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:52.810
If that's what you've decided to do, then do it!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:55.570
Relying too much on machinery
is a bad habit of the modern man!

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:57.820
Yes!

00:08:58.880 --> 00:08:59.950
I'll do it!

00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:13.830
Huh? What's that?

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.450
It's like I saw something jumping around...

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:23.960
Gije! Someone's coming!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.520
So it wasn't completely unmanned?

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:34.400
That was careless!

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.500
If they notice us, it's all over!

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:39.120
We have to deal with the soldiers
 if we want to accomplish anything!

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:40.950
Hand over the wire.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:44.660
I knew it!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:47.670
The Buff Clan?!

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.450
Solo Ship! Ideon!

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:55.270
Do you hear me?!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.650
The Buff Clan has crept in
through the side of the Ideon!

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:58.380
What?

00:09:58.470 --> 00:09:58.970
The Ideon?

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:00.570
All hands, prepare for close combat!

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:02.430
Commander Parkinson!

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:03.140
Do you understand?

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:04.850
This is the Buff Clan!

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:05.890
With your defense force...

00:10:05.930 --> 00:10:08.640
The reinforcements are coming, a
 couple of guerrillas mean nothing!

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.650
Do you think we can hold out for that long?

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:13.370
We could have held them off if it wasn't for you!

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:15.360
If the Ideon gets taken, you're finished.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:16.400
Hatari!

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:17.780
I entrust the Solo Ship to you!

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:19.160
I'm going to take back the Ideon!

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:19.980
Roger!

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:21.410
Open the starboard machine guns!

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:22.870
Start the normal engine!

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.740
Be prepared to take off at any time!

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:29.330
Damn it!

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:31.170
Hurry up!

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:32.630
The enemy has noticed us!

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:38.340
Kasha!

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.130
Moera!

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.840
The Buff Clan has boarded the Ideon!

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.680
Can you hear me? Kasha!

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:45.850
Seems like there's a pilot in
 the other cockpit. Take caution!

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:47.520
Take caution, how?

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:50.000
We need to make the Giant's
controls work only from here!

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:54.730
I know!

00:10:54.940 --> 00:10:55.780
This is it.

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:57.990
I can take over the control system with this.

00:10:58.700 --> 00:10:59.800
How'd you know that?

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:02.240
I've been here once before.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:03.740
I know the basic controls!

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:04.370
Cosmo!

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:06.080
Who are you?!

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.120
What are you doing in the Sol Amber's cockpit?!

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:09.290
It's been a while.

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:10.960
You were called Kasha, right?

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:13.000
I am Gije of the Buff Clan!

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:14.710
The Giant is ours now!

00:11:15.130 --> 00:11:15.960
Gije?!

00:11:16.420 --> 00:11:21.110
If you make any suspicious
 moves, my men might kill you!

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:22.300
Stay put!

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:22.930
Found it!

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:24.050
This is the Giant's layout.

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.060
All right, take over the engine room!

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:26.560
Okay!

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:27.970
There's two passages!

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:29.180
Dogunama! Shiram!

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:30.520
Go to the engine room!

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:32.350
Let's do this!

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:38.070
Damn!

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:45.580
Why, you...

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:15.810
Sir Daram!

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.690
Gije's unit has captured the Giant!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:18.400
Roger!

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:20.190
Send the Ganga Lubu to assist them!

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:21.360
I'm heading out too.

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:23.710
Don't move the Gabro Zan away from here.

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:25.780
They might send backup.

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.070
Enemies at our starboard side!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.410
It's up to you!

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:29.890
Don't let a single unit escape!

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:43.930
Do they really think that's enough
 to take down the Gabro Zan?

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:48.680
Ganga Lubu #2! Heading into the Giant's cave!

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:56.020
It doesn't matter if they've blocked
 off a passage or two, but still...

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.860
They've got some guts to sneak in here!

00:12:59.110 --> 00:12:59.610
Moera!

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:00.140
What do we do?

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:01.820
Sol Amber is the main cockpit!

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.200
They've cut off all power from here.

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:05.530
What about the left and right hatches?

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:06.530
We can't open them!

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:07.320
Why!?

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:08.320
Take a look!

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:10.120
Don't touch it!

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:11.400
What do you mean?

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.330
If you turn that knob, the bomb
 placed on the other side will explode!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.540
That's what they threatened!

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:17.500
No way!

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.860
Can't we reconnect the circuits?

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:21.840
What are we supposed to do?!

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.710
The Solo Ship will never launch at this rate!

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:25.930
The A Block will be loaded
 with missiles in 15 seconds!

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:27.590
Commander Parkinson!

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:28.340
Look at that!

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.850
Your reinforcements are being annihilated!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.430
That's not all the forces Caral has to offer!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.810
There can't be that few of us left!

00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:39.210
Our forces can easily sink that ship!

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.270
Commander Parkinson!

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:42.280
Miss!

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.560
No matter how strong your faith is...

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.820
Caral has been completely destroyed.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:50.120
We need to cooperate with
 the Ideon and Solo Ship now.

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:52.790
But miss, us soldiers...

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.560
Both soldiers and civilians have gotten killed!

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:58.120
Don't make distinctions to protect yourself!

00:13:58.250 --> 00:13:58.960
But...

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.350
How can we cooperate at this point?

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:05.260
Just make sure we've finished
 resupplying before the enemy arrives!

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:07.680
Cosmo!

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:08.430
Thanks!

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:10.850
Here we go!

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:22.440
Bes!

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:24.650
Get in through the leg missile pod!

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:25.280
No way!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.280
It's too far away from Sol Amber's cockpit!

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:28.370
We did it!

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.860
The power is rising! We can move!

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:31.620
Do it!

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:32.410
Yes!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.340
Cosmo managed to get on!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.250
Keep going!

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.560
Can we fire the arm missiles?

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:00.390
It should work!

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:01.020
All right!

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:05.980
Take good aim!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.500
Twenty or thirty of them should to the trick!

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:08.620
Here it comes!

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.650
The Ideon is aiming at us!

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:19.790
With missiles?

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:21.040
Yes!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.020
Joliver! Raise the power!

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.340
We're spreading the barrier!

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:24.960
Roger!

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:25.800
Give me ten seconds!

00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:26.670
We can't wait!

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:27.320
Main cannon!

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:28.590
We have allies over there!

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:29.720
You musn't shoot!

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:31.010
The armory is behind them!

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:32.590
Fire!

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.640
You're finished!

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:50.950
Over there...

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:52.740
All right, open the communication channel!

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.250
I need to know how Gije's doing.

00:15:54.280 --> 00:15:54.700
Yes sir!

00:15:58.380 --> 00:15:59.370
It's still moving!

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:00.080
Continue!

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:00.450
Yes sir!

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:02.960
Sir Daram?

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:09.710
Hatari!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:12.480
I recognize these guerrilla tactics!

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.340
This isn't the regular military!

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:15.760
What are you getting at?

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:18.680
You need to stop the Ideon at once!

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:19.970
How?!

00:16:20.180 --> 00:16:21.620
Ram the Solo Ship into them!

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.520
And who are you?!

00:16:23.820 --> 00:16:25.690
She's our battle advisor!

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:31.980
What was that sound? Something's coming!

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:36.910
Those Logo Dau aliens...!

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:47.290
We're going to crash!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:50.050
Take this!

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:02.010
End of the line!

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:02.850
What'd you say?

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:26.420
You bastard!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:28.580
Eat this!

00:17:30.640 --> 00:17:31.750
You again!

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.140
This is where it ends, Cosmo!

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:39.890
What?!

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:46.350
Is that the Giant machine piloted by Gije?

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:52.890
That Gije! He's taking to much time!

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:00.320
Cosmo...!

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:03.370
You're not taking the Ideon!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:16.660
That Gije! He's running away!

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:19.680
Kasha!

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:20.260
Moera!

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:21.100
Can you hear me?

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:22.640
The Sol-Amber can't move!

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:24.100
You have to start the docking sequence!

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.930
The enemy's capable of breaking our barrier!

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.440
Keep firing the anti-air cannons!

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:29.480
We'll force through!

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:38.300
Moera, do you hear me?

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:40.110
The Solo Ship will cover us.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:41.120
Let's dock!

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:41.740
Roger!

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:45.910
Cosmo!

00:18:45.990 --> 00:18:46.950
We're docking!

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:47.660
Hurry up!

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:49.170
Enemy fighters are approaching!

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:02.260
Sol Conver, docking!

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:16.940
You're in charge of the controls!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:19.530
Forget the fighters, aim for the Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:20.200
Roger!

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:21.160
Moera!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:21.780
Get up!

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:39.420
Damn Giant!

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:50.890
Don't target them both!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.520
Take down one of them first!

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.690
The front, in front!

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.330
Got it, Cosmo!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.440
Here it comes!

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:01.010
They dodged?!

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.040
Sir Daram!

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:19.800
Running away?!

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:22.090
Back off! Right now!

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:24.470
They might have set off another nuclear bomb!

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:25.300
I see!

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:26.630
We're in danger!

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:27.560
Retreat!

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.620
Caral's army has been eliminated.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:53.760
And those Buff Clan aliens might attack us again.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.750
What are we supposed to do?

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:58.790
It's all over.

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:02.920
Even though it's been fifty years
since Caral was first colonized...

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:05.130
It's the same with us.

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:07.010
We felt the same when we evacuated.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.030
We do what we can to survive. That's all.

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:13.180
But when is this fight coming to an end?

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:14.350
I don't know.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.940
The Buff Clan are desperate to obtain the Ideon.

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:19.230
Why don't you just hand over the Ideon?

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:21.360
We thought about it.

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.660
But if we did that, they'd kill all of us Earthlings!

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:28.240
Bes, about what just happened...

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:31.730
The forces we fought weren't part of the regular army.

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:34.620
They are probably a private battle squad.

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:35.370
And?

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:37.290
I don't think they have that much battle strength.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.630
Isn't there another way we can fight them?

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:42.880
Are you certain about that, Karala?

00:21:43.770 --> 00:21:49.860
Even I can tell the difference between a military
 Heavy Mobile Mecha and a custom one.

00:21:50.760 --> 00:21:52.720
You sound convinced.

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:54.910
I don't consider you worthless.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:56.570
However, Gije...

00:21:57.320 --> 00:22:01.450
Our mission is to take the Giant
using only our scarce resources.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:06.500
You were chosen because you had
 some prior knowledge of the target.

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:09.320
But you need to give me better results than this.

00:22:09.920 --> 00:22:11.460
I thoroughly understand.

00:22:11.650 --> 00:22:15.570
But given that even the Ganga Lubu is
no match for the Giant's power...

00:22:15.610 --> 00:22:16.700
No excuses, Gije!

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:18.830
This isn't the army.

00:22:19.320 --> 00:22:22.970
We must get the Giant to receive our payment.

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:23.560
Yes sir.

00:22:23.770 --> 00:22:28.470
That is the only way for you to get back at Harulu!

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:29.180
Yes sir.

00:22:29.410 --> 00:22:31.220
Don't give the enemy any more time!

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:33.350
Daram Zuba.

00:22:34.520 --> 00:22:38.280
A man burning with ambition to strike again.

00:22:39.510 --> 00:22:42.770
Without a delay, the preparations
 for another battle have begun.

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:52.160
<i>The Solo Ship and Ideon are set up with explosives.</i>

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:58.120
<i>Bes and the others come under the
 violent attack of Daram Zuba's troops.</i>

00:22:58.870 --> 00:23:01.580
<i>Chasing after them, Gije boards the Ideon.</i>

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:05.420
<i>Despite being wounded,
 Cosmo challenges him to a duel.</i>

00:23:05.960 --> 00:23:08.380
<i>Does he stand a chance against Gije?</i>

00:23:09.300 --> 00:23:14.080
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon: 
"Ideon's Counterattack"</i>

